<title>JAPAN: TIFFE Euroyen futures end down on share price jump.</title>
<headline>TIFFE Euroyen futures end down on share price jump.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 22 settlement   prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (U)     99.30		   99.32</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The key September three-month Euroyen futures ended slightly down on Wednesday due to a jump in Tokyo share prices.</p>
<p>The September's upperside was capped by the sharp rise in stock prices, a city bank trader said.</p>
<p>Traders said, however, that the September's downside was likely to be limited, as the market's overall view of the economy had not changed.</p>
</text>
